nlohmann/json       MIT                              Fetched, header-only, topology model      M0
hwloc               BSD-3-Clause                     System (pixi), topology discovery         M0/M1
UCX                 BSD-3-Clause                     System (pixi, Linux), transports          M0/M1
rdma-core           BSD-2-Clause or GPL-2.0          System (pixi, Linux), with UCX            M0/M1
opentelemetry-cpp   Apache-2.0                       Fetched, static, symbols hidden           RFC-0002
protobuf            BSD-3-Clause                     Fetched, static, symbols hidden           RFC-0002
abseil              Apache-2.0                       Fetched, static, symbols hidden           RFC-0002
libcurl             curl (MIT-style)                 System, shared, OTLP over HTTP            RFC-0002
NVIDIA CCCL         Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception   Fetched, CUB/Thrust/libcu++               M0
nvbench             Apache-2.0                       Fetched, benchmarks only (not shipped)    M0
nanoarrow           Apache-2.0                       Fetched, Arrow C Device Data Interface    M2
NVML                NVIDIA driver license            dlopen, never linked or bundled           M0/M1
nvCOMP              NVIDIA proprietary, optional     dlopen, never bundled                     M2

